<title>JAPAN: ALPINE SKIING-WORLD CUP DOWNHILL TRAINING PLACINGS.</title>
<headline>ALPINE SKIING-WORLD CUP DOWNHILL TRAINING PLACINGS.</headline>
<dateline>HAKUBA, Japan 1997-02-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results of the second</p>
<p>official training run at the women's World Cup downhill on</p>
<p>Thursday:</p>
<p>  1. Pernilla Wiberg (Sweden) one minute, 37.57 seconds</p>
<p>  2. Warwara Zelenskaja (Russia)	     1:38.06</p>
<p>  3. Regine Cavagnoud (France)		 1:39.09</p>
<p>  4. Stefanie Schuster (Austria)	     1:39.11</p>
<p>  5. Florence Masnada (France)		 1:39.16</p>
<p>  6. Katja Seizinger (Germany)		 1:39.25</p>
